  "notes": "Multi-rate module: 64GFC at 57.8 Gb/s PAM4 with RS(544,514) FEC and BER 1.09E-4; 32GFC at 28.05 Gb/s NRZ with RS(528,514) FEC and BER 1E-6; 16GFC at 14.025 Gb/s NRZ with no FEC and BER 1E-12. RX_LOS asserts when received power is below worst-case receiver sensitivity per active standard. Reach 100 m on OM4 and 70 m on OM3 at 64GFC per EEPROM. Storage temperature –40°C to 85°C (absolute max, not normal operating). Several rx_sensitivity and tx values are OMAouter or OMA peak-to-peak, not average power only.",
